# Copy to .env.local and fill in. .env.local is git-ignored.
#
# Only PUBLIC values belong here. Anything prefixed VITE_ is bundled into the
# browser code and visible to every visitor.
#   - VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY is the public "anon" key. It is safe in the browser
#     ONLY because Row Level Security is enabled on every table.
#   - NEVER put the Supabase service_role key, database password or any other
#     secret in a VITE_ variable. Those live in Supabase Edge Function secrets
#     or the Vercel project's server-side environment variables.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
